## PASTE A — PORTAL LOGIN CREST + ART HERO (all 3 portals)

**What changes:**
1. Login crest: `badge-tiger.svg` → `NET-LION-VOICE-4.png` — students see OBI's face when they unlock
2. SetPw modal icon: same swap
3. Dashboard art hero: `mouse-tiger-confidence.png` as a full-width card below the mode cards — this is the visual statement of the entire program

**CSS to add** (into each portal's `<style>` block, near `.content-card`):

```css
/* Transformation art card */
.art-hero-card {
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.18);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    background: var(--card);
    animation: fadeIn 0.7s ease;
}
.art-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 16/9;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    opacity: 0.88;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
}
.art-hero-card:hover .art-hero-img { opacity: 1; }
.art-hero-caption {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.12);
}
.art-hero-caption .caption-title {
    font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
.art-hero-caption .caption-sub {
    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-top: 3px;
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
    .art-hero-img { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
}
```

